#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:1 026f8c0294d24b28a33a15ed4be90901
msgid "Drag teaching is not implemented"
msgstr "拖动示教未实现"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:3 eaa56f1e875a4d59aed1919abf545f7f
msgid ""
"This stack does **not** implement drag teaching (拖动遥操作): no physical drag-"
"to-teach path, no trajectory record/playback, and no `enter_teach_mode` API."
msgstr ""
"本技术栈 **没有** 实现拖动示教（拖动遥操作）：没有物理拖动示教路径、没有轨迹录制/回放，也没有 `enter_teach_mode` API。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:5 c5d949a7475e4a01a9c8f8b2daa4e87f
msgid ""
"**Implemented** teleop for **Panthera HT** is master–slave **isomorphic "
"teleop** (同构遥操作). On the `panthera-ht` branch that is `./teleop_start.sh` — "
"see [Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md). The package is still named "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller); follow [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Panthera HT** **已实现** 的遥操作是主从 **同构遥操作**。在 `panthera-ht` 分支上即 "
"`./teleop_start.sh` — 见 [Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md)。软件包仍名为 "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)；请跟随 [同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"
